UIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCjtaYtNeWAxUtb_UHHRi7OHQQ3YcHCIEBKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCjtaYtNeWAxUtb_UHHRi7OHQQ3YcHCIIBKAE"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiCjtaYtNeWAxUtb_UHHRi7OHQQ3IcHCIABKBI",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCjtaYtNeWAxUtb_UHHRi7OHQQ3YcHCIQBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiCjtaYtNeWAxUtb_UHHRi7OHQQ3IcHCIMBKBM",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["店面很小，只有七個座位，熱門時段用餐時間會限制在30分鐘的超級小間拉麵店，但是風味很不錯。湯頭可以依據個人口味客製化選擇要淡/正常/鹹，麵條硬度可以選擇軟或/正常硬度。我選檸·雞白湯的正常湯頭，風味就很濃郁，檸檬片和橙片在熱湯內釋放香氣，師父表示泡五分鐘就要拿起來，避免皮的苦味釋放到湯內，但這邊就有個小建議，希望點檸·雞白湯可以多一個小空碟讓用餐者可以放檸檬片，不然直接撈起來不管放餐桌上或是拉麵托盤上，都對店家很不好意思…後來我是先把飯後水果吃掉，將撈起來的檸檬片放在水果磁盤上。另外對於用餐空間也有一個小建議，希望吧台座位後面的牆壁上可以有掛勾，提供給用餐者可以掛一下外套，不然椅子下置物空間也不大，外套沒地方掛只能硬塞在椅子下又很怕掉出來…",null,[0,324]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLY0U5V1RUUmlSVnBNVGxSb1ExSXpWa1JTVmxWNFlqQktNMDlIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLY0U5V1RUUmlSVnBNVGxSb1ExSXpWa1JTVmxWNFlqQktNMDlIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLY0U5V1RUUmlSVnBNVGxSb1ExSXpWa1JTVmxWNFlqQktNMDlIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLY0U5V1RUUmlSVnBNVGxSb1ExSXpWa1JTVmxWNFlqQktNMDlIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLY0U5V1RUUmlSVnBNVGxSb1ExSXpWa1JTVmxWNFlqQktNMDlIWXhBQhAA",[null